---
description: Baseline agent conventions (canonical starter rule)
alwaysApply: true
---

Starter Cursor project rule. Copy `.cursor/rules/` into a consuming repo alongside
the `.AGENT/` scaffold and customize as needed.

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.AGENT/agent.md` at the start of work; follow `.AGENT/agent-run.md`.
- Gitflow: branch from the integration branch, PR back into it, one logical change
  per branch. Do not merge PRs or push to protected branches unless told.
- Never print or commit secret values; secrets are injected as env vars.
- Keep `.AGENT/agent-action-log.md` current; use `.AGENT/handoffs/` (see
  `HANDOFF-TEMPLATE.md`) when handing off work.
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones.
